    Fix fragile debug-flag detection in OpencastRest (#7767)
    
    window.location.search.includes("&debug=true") missed the flag whenever
    debug was the first query parameter (e.g. "?debug=true&foo=bar" has no
    literal "&debug=true" substring).
    
    Use the existing parsedQueryString() helper instead, matching how every
    other query parameter in this module is read.
    
